  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "# Given a sale pricebook entry is active for a product, when a Shopper views the PLP product tile, then the price renders as \"Was [RRP]\" in muted styling and \"Now [sale price]\" in green styling, inline on the same line, per the Figma design.\n# Given a sale pricebook entry is active for a product, when a Shopper views the PDP, then the price renders as \"Was [RRP]\" and \"Now [sale price]\" per the Figma design.\n# Given a sale pricebook entry is active and the item is in the Shopper's cart, when the cart renders, then the Was/Now price treatment is shown per line item.\n# -Given a sale pricebook entry is active for a product, when a Shopper views the Homepage, then the price renders as \"Was [RRP]\" and \"Now [sale price]\" per the Figma design.-\n# Given a sale pricebook entry is active for a product, when a Shopper views their Wishlist, then the price renders as \"Was [RRP]\" and \"Now [sale price]\" per the Figma design.\n# Given a sale pricebook entry is active for a product, when a Shopper views the Recently Viewed Full History, then the price renders as \"Was [RRP]\" and \"Now [sale price]\" per the Figma design.\n# Given a sale item is in the Shopper's cart, when the Shopper proceeds through checkout, then the Was/Now price treatment is shown per line item throughout the checkout flow.\n# Given a product on a Shopper's wishlist has an active sale price, when the Shopper views the wishlist, then the Was/Now price treatment is shown on the product tile.\n# Given a sale pricebook entry is active, when the \"Was\" price renders on any surface, then it always reflects the base RRP — never a previous promotional price or an earlier sale price.\n# Given a sale pricebook entry expires or is deactivated, when a Shopper next views the product, then only the base RRP is displayed with no \"Was/Now\" treatment.\n# Given prices are displayed in a non-AUD currency, when the Was/Now treatment renders, then both the Was and Now prices are shown in the Shopper's local currency using the correct currency formatting per [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46|https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46|smart-link]."
